{
  "start": "scene1",
  "nodes": {
    "scene1": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "万历二十四年，三月。江南细雨。\n\n浔阳楼，本府名楼。今夜灯火通明，楼中丝竹隐隐。",
      "next": "scene2"
    },
    "scene2": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "（趴在窗边看雨）哇——陆大人，这浔阳楼可比临川那破驿站气派多了！这是咱们查完上回那案子的犒赏吗？",
      "next": "scene2b"
    },
    "scene2b": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "……只是路过借宿一夜。明日还要启程回京。",
      "next": "scene2c"
    },
    "scene2c": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "切，您就不能享受一下吗。这楼里的酒闻着就香——对了，刚才楼下那个弹琵琶的姑娘，好漂亮啊！听说是这儿的头牌，叫什么来着……",
      "next": "scene2d"
    },
    "scene2d": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "秋菱。浔阳楼当家花魁。",
      "next": "scene2e"
    },
    "scene2e": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_prologue.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "秋菱！对！本姑娘刚才在楼下还跟她打了个照面——那气质，跟咱们镖局的人完全不是一个路子……行了行了，早点睡吧，明天赶路呢。",
      "next": "scene3"
    },
    "scene3": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_pavilion_main.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "夜里三更。\n\n楼下突然传来一声闷响——紧接着是短促的惊叫。",
      "next": "scene3b"
    },
    "scene3b": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_pavilion_main.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "（猛然坐起）什么声音！？",
      "next": "scene3c"
    },
    "scene3c": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_pavilion_main.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "（已经披衣下楼）走。",
      "next": "scene4"
    },
    "scene4": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "后院青石板上躺着一位女子。颈间缠着一段绛红云纹绸。\n\n这便是方才还在弹琵琶的秋菱。",
      "next": "scene4b"
    },
    "scene4b": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "（捂住嘴）这、这不是刚才那个姑娘吗……！她怎么……从楼上掉下来的？！",
      "next": "scene4c"
    },
    "scene4c": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "（蹲下查看）指甲缝里干净，手心却握着一段红绸。红绸的断口是横向的——这与失足坠落的受力方向不一致。",
      "next": "scene4d"
    },
    "scene4d": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "您是说……不是失足？是被人……",
      "next": "scene4e"
    },
    "scene4e": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "还不能确定。但这红绸的断口方向——是从背后往下拽的。自己抓栏不会留这种痕迹。",
      "next": "scene5"
    },
    "scene5": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "天亮后，鲁知府赶来。只看了一眼便拍板：醉后凭栏，失足跌下。结案。",
      "next": "scene5b"
    },
    "scene5b": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "（小声，气鼓鼓）醉酒失足？！那红绸他不看看吗！本姑娘都看出来不对了——",
      "next": "scene5c"
    },
    "scene5c": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "……所以，这案子我接了。",
      "next": "scene5d"
    },
    "scene5d": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "又来了！上次临川也是这样——您一句'我接了'，就多了三天苦差事。",
      "next": "scene5e"
    },
    "scene5e": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "三天。结案稿发还京之前。",
      "next": "scene5f"
    },
    "scene5f": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "（叹气，然后拍胸脯）行吧！本姑娘上回陪您查了个毒杀案，这回坠楼——总比朱砂那些弯弯绕绕好懂吧？陆大人，您吩咐！",
      "next": "scene6"
    },
    "scene6": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "浔阳楼里的人都还在。案发时楼里至少有五六个人——先把他们的话都听一遍。",
      "next": "scene6b"
    },
    "scene6b": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "明白！本姑娘负责竖耳朵！……对了陆大人，这回能不能别什么都'嗯'一个字就打发我？",
      "next": "scene6c"
    },
    "scene6c": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "陆昭",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "next": "scene6d"
    },
    "scene6d": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "凌瑶",
      "text": "！！您故意的吧！！",
      "next": "scene7"
    },
    "scene7": {
      "background": "res://assets/cn/scenes/xunyang_courtyard.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "centered": true,
      "silent": true,
      "text": "【操作说明】\n\n• 右侧菜单：地图 / 对话 / 移动 / 探索 / 笔记本 / 指证\n• 「讨论」：随时与凌瑶交流，获取下一步方向建议\n• 跨地点移动花费一个时段；探索某处也要花时段\n• 三天内找出真凶——否则鲁知府的「醉后失足」就是定论",
      "end": true
    }
  }
}